## Acceptance criteria

- [x] All five supplied images have been visually inspected, not merely enumerated.
- [x] Every prepared image maps to an untouched source and reproducible crop.
- [x] No cake content is generated, retouched away or misrepresented.
- [x] Screenshot quality and already-clipped subjects remain honestly disclosed.
- [x] Private originals are outside the intended public asset directory.
- [x] Validate the current sticker allowlist excludes masks, recipes and manifests;
  preserve source-clipped details and full-JPG enlargement (workstream 09).
- [ ] Future deployment continues to exclude those originals.

